<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 9.760 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 35-day T-bills sell at average 9.760 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian central bank treasury bill sales announced on Wednesday from Friday's weekly auction.</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			25 April     18 April</p>
<p>    TENOR				 35 days	39 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   1,720	  1,250</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    1,820	  1,300</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   9.7600 pct   9.7500 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  9.8415 pct   9.8520 pct</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
